OL,3,ABank of England holds interest rates at
OL,4,A3.75%, but governor says high energy
OL,5,Acosts may lead to increase
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bank of England has held interest
OL,8,Frates at 3.75%
OL,10,FSix members of the Monetary Policy
OL,11,FCommittee - including Governor Andrew
OL,12,FBailey - voted to hold the rate, while
OL,13,Fthe other three wanted an increase to
OL,14,F4%
OL,16,FThe hold comes despite rising inflation
OL,17,F- the UK rate is 3.1%, well above the
OL,18,FBank's 2% target
OL,20,FThe Bank's governor, Andrew Bailey,
OL,21,Fsays higher energy costs would make an
OL,22,Finterest rate rise more likely
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
